{"id":"odnazhdy","lemma":"однажды","pos":"adv","rank":318,"glosses":["once, one day, once upon a time","once (only one time)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/da/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B4%D1%8B.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B4%D1%8B.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Однажды это случилось.","en":"It happened once.","words":[null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"}]},{"text":"Я, помню, видел его однажды.","en":"I remember seeing him once.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to remember","l":"помнить"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},{"g":"him / his"},null]},{"text":"Однажды всё это будет твоим.","en":"One day, all this will be yours.","words":[null,{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"}]},{"text":"Я был там однажды.","en":"I've been there once.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Однажды это должно было случиться.","en":"It was bound to happen some day.","words":[null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"it must be, probably"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"to happen"}]}]}